{
  "name": "Stage 01 - Topic Research to Script Draft Pipeline (Demo)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111201",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1400, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Pivot demo workflow\nThis workflow is a SAFE, NON-FUNCTIONAL demonstration of\nthe FIRST real automation target: research -> idea bank\n-> topic scoring -> source documentation -> assisted\nscript draft -> state logging. It uses only fictitious\nsample data, calls no external services, and requires\nno credentials. See docs/06-roadmap.md.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 400
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111202",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1420, -60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "f1", "name": "topic_id", "type": "string", "value": "TOPIC-DEMO-0001" },
            { "id": "f2", "name": "working_title", "type": "string", "value": "[EXAMPLE] Why does this European microstate still exist?" },
            { "id": "f3", "name": "category", "type": "string", "value": "curiosities" },
            { "id": "f4", "name": "region", "type": "string", "value": "Europe" },
            { "id": "f5", "name": "trend_score", "type": "number", "value": 7 },
            { "id": "f6", "name": "competition_score", "type": "number", "value": 4 },
            { "id": "f7", "name": "novelty_score", "type": "number", "value": 8 },
            { "id": "f8", "name": "geographic_relevance_score", "type": "number", "value": 8 },
            { "id": "f9", "name": "sources_documented", "type": "boolean", "value": true },
            { "id": "f10", "name": "source_count", "type": "number", "value": 2 }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111203",
      "name": "Set Fictitious Topic Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-1180, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1) Idea bank intake\nManual Trigger simulates a new topic idea being\nlogged. The Set node fills in FICTITIOUS demo\nfields matching templates/topic-registry.csv -\nedit these to test each branch below.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 300
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111204",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Idea Bank",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1200, 20]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            { "id": "c1", "leftValue": "={{$json.topic_id}}", "rightValue": "", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEmpty" } },
            { "id": "c2", "leftValue": "={{$json.working_title}}", "rightValue": "", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEmpty" } },
            { "id": "c3", "leftValue": "={{$json.category}}", "rightValue": "", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEmpty" } }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111205",
      "name": "Validate Required Fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [-940, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "e1", "name": "status", "type": "string", "value": "BLOCKED_INVALID_INTAKE" },
            { "id": "e2", "name": "block_reason", "type": "string", "value": "One or more required topic fields are missing." }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111206",
      "name": "Blocked - Invalid Intake",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-700, 480]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "s1", "name": "final_score", "type": "number", "value": "={{ Math.round(((Number($json.trend_score) + Number($json.competition_score) + Number($json.novelty_score) + Number($json.geographic_relevance_score)) / 4) * 10) / 10 }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111207",
      "name": "Compute Final Score",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-700, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2) Topic scoring\nMirrors prompts/topic-scoring-prompt.md: averages\ntrend, competition, novelty, and geographic-relevance\nscores into final_score. A real deployment would call\nan AI step here instead of hardcoded numbers.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 320
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111208",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Scoring",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-720, -60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            { "id": "d1", "leftValue": "={{$json.final_score}}", "rightValue": 6, "operator": { "type": "number", "operation": "gte" } }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111209",
      "name": "final_score >= 6.0?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [-460, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "r1", "name": "status", "type": "string", "value": "IDEA_BACKLOG" },
            { "id": "r2", "name": "block_reason", "type": "string", "value": "final_score below the 6.0 recommendation threshold." }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111210",
      "name": "Backlog - Low Score",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-460, 480]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3) Source documentation gate\nA topic can only reach script drafting once its\nsupporting facts are logged in\ntemplates/source-registry.csv (sources_documented\n= true and source_count > 0). This mirrors the\nStage 1 gate pattern, applied to research sources\ninstead of whole-video rights.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 320
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111211",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Source Gate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-480, -60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            { "id": "u1", "leftValue": "={{$json.sources_documented}}", "rightValue": true, "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "true" } },
            { "id": "u2", "leftValue": "={{$json.source_count}}", "rightValue": 0, "operator": { "type": "number", "operation": "gt" } }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111212",
      "name": "Sources Documented?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [-220, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "p1", "name": "status", "type": "string", "value": "SOURCES_PENDING" },
            { "id": "p2", "name": "block_reason", "type": "string", "value": "No verified sources logged yet in source-registry.csv." }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111213",
      "name": "Pending - Sources Needed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-220, 480]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "a1", "name": "status", "type": "string", "value": "SCRIPT_DRAFT_READY" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111214",
      "name": "Approved - SCRIPT_DRAFT_READY",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [20, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4) Outcomes\nOnly the top path reaches SCRIPT_DRAFT_READY,\nwhere prompts/script-draft-assist-prompt.md would\nbe used by a human writer. Every other path ends\nin IDEA_BACKLOG, SOURCES_PENDING, or\nBLOCKED_INVALID_INTAKE. Visual-asset licensing\n(n8n/visual-asset-rights-gate.json) happens later,\nafter the script exists - not in this workflow.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 340
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111215",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Outcomes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, -80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "s1", "name": "execution_summary", "type": "string", "value": "={{ 'topic_id=' + $json.topic_id + ' | status=' + $json.status + ' | reason=' + ($json.block_reason || 'n/a') }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111216",
      "name": "Execution Summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [280, 300]
    }
  ],
